description Avatar 59 fps source, no frame generation, b:vsync present, -lock -lag 75 -dejit. One benchmark test, no fade at either end. 59:60 is a non-integer ratio, so the bracket phase ramps through a full source period once per second and the blend compositor synthesizes for roughly half of every beat.
